  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Capacity of Diaspora Affairs Directorate in MOFA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot; The development objective is to enhance the structure and capacity-building of the Diaspora Division in Ministry of Foreign Affairscomma amongst others.  The grant is part of the Bank#s support in enhancing capacity of Kenya to carry out its core functions of developing and maintaining productive institutional relationships with its Diaspora. 1. The development objective is to enhance the capacity of the International Jobs and Diaspora Office (Directorate) in the Ministry of Foreign Affairs (MoFA) to mobilize the Kenyan Diaspora for development.  Emphasis will be given to mainstreaming the Diaspora into national development as outlined in the Kenyan Economic blueprint: &quot;&quot;Vision 2030&quot;&quot;.   Enhancing the capacity of the Directorate would lead to the development of a national Diaspora Engagement Strategic Policy Framework and Plan of Action; and would strengthen the Government of Kenya&apos;s communications withcomma outreach tocomma and information gathering from its Diaspora.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
